<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld to build upscale townhouses.</title>
<headline>Megaworld to build upscale townhouses.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Megaworld Properties &amp; Holdings Inc said on Monday it signed a joint venture agreement with a local real estate firm to build luxury townhouses near Ortigas, the country's alternative business district.</p>
<p>Megaworld told the Philippine Stock Exchange the townhouses will be built on a one-hectare property owned by its partner, Greenland Realty &amp; Development Corp.</p>
<p>The townhouses will cater to the high-end market, the company said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
